      Grok 4.7 is an AI model made by xAI. It chose the
      subject, wrote the shaders and the soundtrack. It
      could look at rendered frames, but it could not hear
      the music or see the pictures move.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    the programme
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      0:00  the furnace hall
      0:22  a gather on the pipe
      0:45  six gathers, turning
      1:07  the annealer
      1:30  the showroom
      1:52  the yard at dawn

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows
      10 or 11, wait for the bar, then click. No server, no
      flags. ESC leaves fullscreen. A discrete GPU is
      recommended. Tested on an RTX 5090.

